{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_08392","headline":"泾溪东亭寄郑少府谔 · 李白","name":"泾溪东亭寄郑少府谔","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"我游东亭不见君，沙上行将白鹭羣。\n白鹭行时散飞去，又如雪点青山云。\n欲往泾溪不辞远，龙门蹙波虎眼转。\n杜鹃花开春已阑，归向陵阳钓鱼晚。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李白","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_08392.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_08392","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}